#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0887 expect=violation domain=ADPPK
#note "Subclass-scoped (D21): the rule gates on Data_Structures ['BASIC DATA STRUCTURE'] AND Subclasses ['POPULATION PHARMACOKINETIC ANALYSIS'], with no Domains facet. PARAMCD/AVAL give AdamDataStructureDetector the BDS indicator; the remaining NONMEM columns give AdamSubclassDetector its popPK signature (a control column EVID or MDV, plus >=3 of DV/MDV/AMT/EVID/CMT). EVID is absent, so the check fires."
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when EVID is not present in an ADPPKIG v1.0 dataset.
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset ADPPK
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col MDV     type=Num
col DV      type=Num
col AMT     type=Num
col CMT     type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | CONC | 12.5 | 0 | 12.5 | 0 | 1
---
